---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const lastUpdated = "October 16, 2026";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy & Cookies | Fjord Labs"
  description="What the fjord-labs.com website collects, the Google Analytics cookies it uses with your consent, and how to change your choice."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-bark mb-2">Privacy &amp; cookies</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-bark/40 mb-8">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="prose-article">
        <p>
          This page covers the fjord-labs.com website, run by Fjord Labs AB in Sweden. Our
          apps have their own privacy policies, linked from each app's page.
        </p>

        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          Nothing that identifies you. There are no accounts, forms or newsletters on this
          site. Purchases happen on Etsy, under
          <a href="https://www.etsy.com/legal/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Etsy's privacy policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 id="cookies">Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p>
          If you click <strong>Accept</strong> in the cookie banner, we use Google Analytics to
          see which guides people read, where visitors come from, and which links they follow,
          such as the links to our Etsy shop. It sets <code>_ga</code> cookies and is not linked
          to your name or email. If you click <strong>Decline</strong>, or don't choose,
          Google Analytics never loads and no cookies are set.
        </p>
        <p>
          Your choice is remembered in your browser's local storage. You can change it at any
          time with <a href="#cookies" data-cookie-settings>Cookie settings</a>, also at the
          bottom of every page.
        </p>

        <h2>Other services the pages load</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>GitHub Pages</strong> hosts the site and keeps standard server logs, such as IP addresses.</li>
          <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> serves the fonts the pages use.</li>
          <li><strong>Etsy</strong> serves the product photos.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Under the GDPR you can ask what data we hold about you, and ask us to correct or
          delete it. Write to
          <a href="mailto:fjordlabs.app@gmail.com">fjordlabs.app@gmail.com</a>. You can also
          complain to the Swedish Authority for Privacy Protection (IMY).
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
